<title>USA: Vanguard adds Wichita-Phoenix service.</title>
<headline>Vanguard adds Wichita-Phoenix service.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vanguard Airlines Inc said Tuesday it will begin non-stop service between Wichita, Kan. and Phoenix, Ariz. on October 17.</p>
<p>The flights will operate to Phoenix on Thursday evenings and return to Wichita on Monday evenings. A special one-way introductory fare of $59 is valid for travel through December 18, with blackout dates from November 22 to December 2. Reservations must be made by midnight October 16.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
